#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:823
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Jina (k.m. Mama)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Hiki ni kiwango cha sauti ya simu kwa kila njia ya kutoa sauti. Kiwango "
"hutumika kiotomatiki simu inapounganishwa na kila mara njia ya kutoa sauti "
"inapobadilika wakati wa simu, na mabadiliko ya kitelezi husikika papo hapo. "
"Maunzi hutumia viwango kwa hatua kubwa, na spika ya sikioni haiwi kimya "
"kabisa kamwe. Kiwango cha Bluetooth huhifadhiwa kwa ajili ya usaidizi ujao "
"wa uelekezaji."

